      "markdown": "| Reference   | Description        |\n|-------------|--------------------|\n| A           | Intake air         |\n| B           | Air/oil mixture    |\n| C           | Oil                |\n| D           | Wet compressed air |\n| F           | Condensate         |\n| G           | Dry compressed air |"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
