      "bbox": {
        "l": 62.23,
        "t": 226.68100000000004,
        "r": 373.24949999999967,
        "b": 214.50400000000002
      },
      "content": "Note: The cooling fan is not provided on water-cooled compressors."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0136",
      "reading_order": 178,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 28.21,
        "t": 199.235,
        "r": 89.711,
        "b": 186.95900000000006
      },
      "content": "Description",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0137",
      "reading_order": 179,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 62.2297,
        "t": 179.88049999999998,
        "r": 531.7801000000005,
        "b": 141.30349999999999
      },
      "content": "Air drawn through filter (AF) and open inlet valve (IV) into compressor element (E) is compressed. A mix of compressed air and oil flows into the air receiver/oil separator (AR) via check valve (CV). The air is discharged through outlet valve (AV) via minimum pressure valve (Vp) and air cooler (Ca)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0138",
      "reading_order": 180,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 62.2297,
        "t": 127.08050000000003,
        "r": 296.2568999999998,
        "b": 114.90350000000001
      },
      "content": "The air cooler is provided with a moisture trap (MT)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0139",
      "reading_order": 181,
      "section": "Description",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 62.2297,
        "t": 100.68050000000005,
        "r": 519.8055000000011,
        "b": 74.52359999999999
      },
      "content": "On Full-Feature compressors, the air flows through air dryer (DR) before it is discharged through outlet valve(AV). Also see section Air dryer."
    }
  ]
